    "playbook": {
      "rules": 5,
      "examples": 10,
      "chars": 1948,
      "text": "House rules, learned from labelled examples:\n- Model confuses feature requests or general praise/feedback with specific product inquiries due to overlapping keywords like 'add', 'support', 'plan'. These go to feedback, not product_question.\n- Model incorrectly tags positive feedback about shipping speed/packaging as a shipping issue instead of general feedback. These go to feedback, not shipping.\n- Model mislabels shipping-related queries (tracking, delivery) as billing when payment timing or transaction context is mentioned. These go to shipping, not billing.\n- Model confuses delivery instructions (e.g., neighbor drop-off) with account management due to user authentication context. These go to shipping, not account_access.\n- Model treats plan change or feature availability questions as billing issues when pricing or plan names are mentioned. These go to product_question, not billing.\n\nWorked examples:\nTicket: Hey team, it would be great if offline mode supported more file types. Cheers\nLabel: feedback\nTicket: Can you bring back the old widget? The new one is harder to use. Thanks.\nLabel: feedback\nTicket: Please add export to PDF to the Team plan, my whole team would use it. Thanks.\nLabel: feedback\nTicket: Good morning. Any plans to support Galaxy S23? I would switch my whole team over. Appreciate it.\nLabel: feedback\nTicket: My order #LUM-8842 shows delivered but nothing at my door. Need tracking help.\nLabel: shipping\nTicket: My replacement device hasn't moved in 5 days — tracking stuck at 'label created'.\nLabel: shipping\nTicket: Parcel marked delivered but received empty padded mailer. Need investigation.\nLabel: shipping\nTicket: Need a return label for the defective dock — RMA approved but no email yet.\nLabel: shipping\nTicket: What file formats does the Pro plan export support right now?\nLabel: product_question\nTicket: Does the Team plan include admin analytics or is that a separate add-on?\nLabel: product_question"
    },
